* PTM 180nm CMOS — Generic model para LTspice
* Fuente: Predictive Technology Model, Arizona State University
* VDD = 1.8V, Tox = 4nm

.model NMOS_VTH NMOS level=14
+ version=4.0 tox=4e-9 toxe=4e-9 toxp=3e-9 toxm=4e-9
